{"id":786596,"title":"31｜AutoGen模型配置以及场景演示","content":"本课程介绍了autogen studio中模型配置的全过程。首先，为解决系统bug，需在Anaconda命令行工具中设置OpenAPI-K环境变量，并重新激活环境。接着，在autogen studio界面中添加并测试新模型，包括GPD 3.5和Azure OpenAI模型，确保连接无误。对于本地部署的大模型，后续将讲解如何链接。配置完成后，调整agent和workflow以使用新模型。验证时，通过创建绘画任务观察系统反应，发现primary assistant与用户代理协同工作，自动处理任务中的错误如缺少库文件，最终生成可用结果。这一过程展示了agent在无需人工干预下实现持续反馈与优化的能力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":407005,"user_name":"Geek_GO","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3175783,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"306A3FD9082FD8","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776689100,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":3,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"模型添加还是不会啊！很多你都是自己跳过了","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":398960,"user_name":"都市夜归人","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1071909,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"DFF59BE3D80B42","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/5b/25/d78cc1fe.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742799517,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"老师得即使更新啊，新版本和这个不一样了，无法操作","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":397386,"user_name":"天敌","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1059944,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"CD29A622197197","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/2c/68/c299bc71.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738228995,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"老师，这个代码是在哪里运行的？会不会被诱导执行恶意代码呢？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":392678,"user_name":"Eric","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1205698,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"06BE5025CA56D2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/65/c2/5f00485d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721533215,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"prod